A '''hyperlane''' ran through the [[Tion Cluster]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]], branching off the [[Perlemian Trade Route]] at [[Lianna]] and running east to the [[Cadinth system]] before ending at the [[Jaminere system]].<ref name="TFABG" />

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this hyperlane was known as the [[Cadinth Run]] and was mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

